"reason": "The area inside the red contour shows a building in T1 and bare ground/soil in T2, which represents a disappearance or demolition rather than an appearance (new construction). According to the scope card, 'Land, soil or vegetation in T1 with a building in T2 is new construction', but here we have the reverse (building in T1, land in T2), so it does not count as an appeared building."
